      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在這當中，寶可夢中心：冬日大道的\n精靈球營業額是遠遠落後的最後一名……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728901975764E2DFF0C5BF653EF59224E2D5FC3FF1A51AC65E5592790537684000A7CBE9748740371DF696D984D662F90609060843D5F8C768467005F8C4E00540D2026202600100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但只要有某隻寶可夢在的話，\n一切都能解決。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n首先請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽我說作戰名稱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4653EA8981670967D096BB5BF653EF5922572876848A71FF0C000A4E00520790FD80FD89E36C7A300200100001BE00000A999651488ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D62118AAA4F5C6230540D7A31300200100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是，哎呀球賣翻天計畫！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662FFF0C54CE544074038CE37FFB59298A08756BFF01FF0100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我來為<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說明。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362114F8670BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA660E300200100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "櫃台的這一帶\n有點空蕩蕩的對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6AC353F0768490194E005E36000A67099EDE7A7A8569856976845C0D5427FF1F00100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有酷似精靈球的\n寶可夢「<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>哎呀球菇<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>」在這邊的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大家就會被吸引去買精靈球的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981670991774F3C7CBE974874037684000A5BF653EF5922300C00100002FF00000654CE5440740383C700100002FF000000300D57289019908A76848A71FF0C00100001BE00000A59275BB65C31670388AB54385F1553BB8CB77CBE974874037684FF0100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
